<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AmeriGas said cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AmeriGas said cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter cut its rating of AmeriGas Partners LP to a neutral rating from its prior rating of buy, according to a Dean Witter source.</p>
<p>-- AmeriGas shares closed at 25 on Monday.</p>
</text>
